sequenceDiagram
    actor Élève
    participant Client as Client (Web/Mobile)
    participant API as API Laravel
    participant Redis
    participant DB as MariaDB

    Élève->>Client: Démarre la vidéo

    Client->>+API: POST /api/watch-sessions/request\n{ video_id, segment_start }
    Note right of API: Génère token HMAC-SHA256\n+ nonce aléatoire 32 chars
    API->>Redis: SET watch_nonce:{nonce} "pending" EX 150
    API-->>-Client: { token, seg_start: 0, seg_end: 30, expires_at }

    rect rgb(20, 50, 20)
        Note over Élève,Client: ⏱ L'élève visionne réellement 30 secondes
    end

    Client->>+API: POST /api/watch-sessions/heartbeat\n{ token }
    API->>API: Vérifie signature HMAC-SHA256
    API->>Redis: GET watch_nonce:{nonce} → "pending"
    API->>API: Vérifie fenêtre temporelle

    alt Valide (signature ✓ · nonce ✓ · timing ✓)
        API->>Redis: SET watch_nonce:{nonce} "used" EX 300
        API->>DB: UPDATE video_progress\nSET watched_seconds_validated += 30
        API-->>-Client: { validated_seconds, completion_percent, status }
    else Invalide
        API-->>Client: 422 — motif précis
    end
